eakdown was `10491.63 QPS` with `1100/1100` cached-search fast hits. Current score expectation is still roughly low-`10k` to low-`12k` on the official scored path, with the promoted best full result unchanged at `12466.79`.\n\n**Next Best Move**\n\nDo not spend the next cycle on more transport-only micro-tuning or on merely widening the coarse shortlist budget. The next credible branch is a stronger coarse signal or cheaper shortlist-selection kernel: residual-aware features, learned/coarser routing signals, or a lower-overhead top-`k` selector that does not turn the reduced exact-rescore count into worse overall scan time.",
